one of my curses as organizer is i rarely get to attend the conference i run. so i basically 24/7 watch back talks with everyone else after the show

this one was VERY well paced and argued: fighting slop with slop — @vaibcode, Boundary https://t.co/vRckyyntm6 

@btaylor asked for an ai native programming language on our pod. as a PL fan I’m really glad someone is rethinking how code runs from first principles. Being slop-tolerant is 100x more valuable than being anti- slop
